{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror adventure where reality quietly unravels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayumi wakes up in a strange library with no memory of how she got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, she performs her usual duties \u2014 sorting books, maintaining order \u2014 but something isn\u2019t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality bends, memories resurface, and Ayumi starts to question what is real \u2014 and what the library wants her to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the truth, she must explore the corridors and face the secrets hidden deep within the stacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror set in a looping-world environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments inspired by Japanese urban legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted puzzles that test observation and logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scares that respond to player choices and actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555930?t=1761546623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555930?t=1761546623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555930/d321c597c458edcbaac22e200f2136d70c0bc12f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761546623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555930/d321c597c458edcbaac22e200f2136d70c0bc12f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761546623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"descript